  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116086",
      "title": "Preparing A Non-Class Value For Injection",
      "lectureOrder": 189,
      "videoOrder": 181,
      "sourceHash": "6b4970d89e8eaecb9154431967da6265fe1caf0f76a00403c3f50341f64d1ad6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 2.01,
          "en": "Now that we learned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.01,
          "end": 4.8,
          "en": "about custom injection tokens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.8,
          "end": 8.19,
          "en": "and how we can provide a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.19,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "in this case a service class with this longer form here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 14.91,
          "en": "we can use this knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.91,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "to also provide non-service values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 21.12,
          "en": "to our Angular application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.12,
          "end": 26.04,
          "en": "Because while services are typically the most common thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.04,
          "end": 28.56,
          "en": "you might wanna provide and inject,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.56,
          "end": 32.25,
          "en": "and that's why you would use the shortcut notation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.25,
          "end": 33.42,
          "en": "there typically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.42,
          "end": 35.46,
          "en": "But whilst that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 40.46,
          "en": "services are not the only thing you can provide and inject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.499,
          "end": 44.19,
          "en": "Instead, you can provide any value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.19,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "to your services Components and Directives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 51.016,
          "en": "And for example, in this application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.016,
          "end": 55.192,
          "en": "I have this dropdown, this filter dropdown,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.192,
          "end": 58.95,
          "en": "where users can choose whether they want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.95,
          "end": 60.9,
          "en": "to view all tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.9,
          "end": 63.57,
          "en": "or adjust the open tasks, the in-progress tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 65.16,
          "en": "or the completed tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.16,
          "end": 67.95,
          "en": "And in the task item component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.95,
          "end": 70.135,
          "en": "I have a similar dropdown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.135,
          "end": 74.392,
          "en": "where I show almost the same options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.392,
          "end": 77.88,
          "en": "with the exception of the all option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.88,
          "end": 81.78,
          "en": "since this dropdown here is about changing the status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.78,
          "end": 83.78999999999999,
          "en": "of a single task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.78999999999999,
          "end": 87.93,
          "en": "So there we can set it to open, in progress, or done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.93,
          "end": 91.65,
          "en": "So I have some shared values here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.65,
          "end": 95.75999999999999,
          "en": "and therefore we could outsource these shared values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.75999999999999,
          "end": 99.24000000000001,
          "en": "and inject them into those Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.24000000000001,
          "end": 103.013,
          "en": "into the tasks list and the task item Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.013,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "so that we can use it there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 110.96000000000001,
          "en": "And that's what I'll do here to demonstrate this process",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.36,
          "end": 114.965,
          "en": "of providing a non-service value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.965,
          "end": 119.357,
          "en": "For that, in the task model TS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.357,
          "end": 124.357,
          "en": "I'll export a new constant value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.093,
          "end": 130.093,
          "en": "which I'll name task status options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.47,
          "end": 132.183,
          "en": "The name is up to you of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.733,
          "end": 136.452,
          "en": "And this will be an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.452,
          "end": 141.32,
          "en": "where I want to have a couple of objects inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.32,
          "end": 145.218,
          "en": "And every object should have a value property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.218,
          "end": 149.28,
          "en": "which should hold the values I wanna bind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.28,
          "end": 153.9,
          "en": "as values in my templates to these option elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 153.9,
          "end": 157.95,
          "en": "So what I'm using here as values for the value property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 157.95,
          "end": 161.01,
          "en": "open, in progress, and done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 161.01,
          "end": 164.37,
          "en": "that's what I wanna store here under a value property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.37,
          "end": 166.44299999999998,
          "en": "in this object, in this array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.7,
          "end": 169.773,
          "en": "So I'll start with open,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 171,
          "end": 175.11,
          "en": "then I'll add a task status property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 175.11,
          "end": 176.49,
          "en": "and set this to open.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.49,
          "end": 181.49,
          "en": "So picking up that status I'm using in my task objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.488,
          "end": 186.48,
          "en": "And then I'll add a text property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 186.48,
          "end": 190.11,
          "en": "which should hold the value that's shown to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 190.11,
          "end": 192.54,
          "en": "So in this case here, open written like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 192.54,
          "end": 196.419,
          "en": "with a capital O, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 196.419,
          "end": 198.87,
          "en": "And I'll now repeat that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.87,
          "end": 202.07999999999998,
          "en": "for all three shared options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 202.07999999999998,
          "end": 204.633,
          "en": "So also for in progress,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 206.1,
          "end": 210,
          "en": "written like this, since in my dropdowns,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 210,
          "end": 213.123,
          "en": "I have in progress as a value like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 214.82999999999998,
          "end": 218.67000000000002,
          "en": "And that has a text of in progress written like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.67000000000002,
          "end": 222.48,
          "en": "and will be mapped to this task internal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 222.48,
          "end": 224.913,
          "en": "its in progress value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 225.99,
          "end": 228,
          "en": "So the text is in progress like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228,
          "end": 232.203,
          "en": "and the task status is in underscore progress.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 233.267,
          "end": 236.82,
          "en": "And then the last object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.82,
          "end": 239.816,
          "en": "in this array will have a value of done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 239.816,
          "end": 243.158,
          "en": "since that is what I'm using as a value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 243.158,
          "end": 248.158,
          "en": "a text of completed and will map to the done status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 249.33,
          "end": 252.933,
          "en": "So that's done and text is completed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 254.34,
          "end": 257.19,
          "en": "We can also add a type annotation here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 257.19,
          "end": 261.27,
          "en": "and make it clear that we'll have an array of objects here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 261.27,
          "end": 263.61,
          "en": "That's how we would set this up in TypeScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 263.61,
          "end": 265.41,
          "en": "An array of objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 265.41,
          "end": 268.17,
          "en": "where every object will have a value property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 268.17,
          "end": 269.343,
          "en": "which is any string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 270.48,
          "end": 274.02,
          "en": "We'll have a text property, which is any string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 274.02,
          "end": 276.9,
          "en": "and we'll have a task status property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 276.9,
          "end": 280.983,
          "en": "which is of the type task status I defined up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 282.6,
          "end": 285.54,
          "en": "And actually the value property is not any string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 285.54,
          "end": 289.219,
          "en": "but it's open, in progress,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 289.219,
          "end": 292.923,
          "en": "or done, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 294.21,
          "end": 295.8,
          "en": "And we could try to merge that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 295.8,
          "end": 298.56,
          "en": "with that task status and reuse that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 298.56,
          "end": 301.44,
          "en": "But here so that we don't have to change all the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 301.44,
          "end": 303.79,
          "en": "and all the templates, I'll leave it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 304.86,
          "end": 307.8,
          "en": "So that's now my task status options constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 307.8,
          "end": 309.75,
          "en": "which is being exported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 309.75,
          "end": 311.61,
          "en": "and it's now this value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 311.61,
          "end": 315.66,
          "en": "this array full of objects which I wanna provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.66,
          "end": 318.691,
          "en": "to my application so that I can then inject",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 318.691,
          "end": 322.773,
          "en": "and use it in the Components that need that data.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
